{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act46side_level_act46side_08_beg","storyGroup":"act46side","storySort":17,"storyDependence":"act46side_level_act46side_07_end","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OS-8","storyName":"宣告在途","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"因为开斯特公爵煽动的舆论，恩希欧迪斯在谢拉格的处境变得被动。\n维多利亚记者走访民间，却突然遭人袭击并被掳走。当她醒来时，看到了本应已经死亡的菈塔托丝。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act46side/level_act46side_08_beg","avgTag":"行动前","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act46side_08","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":15,"next":17,"characters":["维多利亚记者","匆忙的谢拉格人","温和的谢拉格人","愤怒的谢拉格人","谢拉格儿童","模糊的声音","哈洛德","恩希欧迪斯","？？？","布朗陶家护卫","菈塔托丝","锏"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":1},{"type":"stopmusic","id":2},{"type":"dialog","id":3},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/77/Avg_bg_45_g8_kjeragstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$mist_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_mist_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":7},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":8},{"type":"text","text":"寂静与空旷令人更觉寒冷，记者背着沉重的背包缓慢向前，踏在积雪上的声响清晰可闻。","id":9},{"type":"dialog","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"连这里的人都在变少......","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......欸？","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":17},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":18},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":19},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":20},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_273_1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":21},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","id":23},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":24},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":25},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":26},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"女士！抱歉打扰您，可以问您几个简短的问题吗？","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_273_1$1","focus":"r","id":29},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的谢拉格人","text":"有什么问题？","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C2/Avg_avg_npc_273_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#11$1","focus":"m","id":31},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"如今喀兰贸易——","id":32,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_273_1$1","focus":"r","id":33},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的谢拉格人","text":"我不想听这几个字。","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C2/Avg_avg_npc_273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的谢拉格人","text":"让恩希欧迪斯大人出来说说，签那几个协议的前因后果。","id":35,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C2/Avg_avg_npc_273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"匆忙的谢拉格人","text":"什么“资源换发展”，结果换来了这一场天灾，他要怎么解释？","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C2/Avg_avg_npc_273_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":37},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_273_1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"200,0","duration":"1","id":39},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":40},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"2","block":"true","id":41},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......","id":43},{"type":"dialog","id":44},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":45},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":46},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"none","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"在记者还在消化愤怒的言辞时，这名谢拉格人早已拂衣而去。","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-100,0","duration":"0","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":52},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":54},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","id":55},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-70,0","duration":"2","block":"true","id":56},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":57},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","focus":"m","id":58},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":59},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......这位先生，请留步！","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温和的谢拉格人","text":"你是，来自维多利亚的记者吧？","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_278_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温和的谢拉格人","text":"最近谢拉格可不太平，连本地人都更愿意躲在家里，你得小心了。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_278_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"但越到这种时候，就越不能够恐惧，否则我就不配拿起相机。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......还是感谢您的提醒。不过我想了解的是，如今您对恩希欧迪斯最真实的看法是？","id":67,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","focus":"l","id":68},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温和的谢拉格人","text":"嗯......抱歉，维多利亚的记者，我觉得他欺骗了谢拉格人，但维多利亚确实值得怀疑。","id":69,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_278_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温和的谢拉格人","text":"这么多年来，谢拉格改变有多大我也看在眼里，要是说恩希欧迪斯大人没有苦衷显然也不属实。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_278_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"温和的谢拉格人","text":"要是蔓珠院的大长老现在能出来说两句话就好了——","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8B/Avg_avg_npc_278_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":72},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","focus":"all","id":73},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","focus":"all","id":74},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_throwstone","id":75},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":76},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_windowbreak","id":77},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":78},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":79},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","focus":"all","id":80},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_278_1$1","afrom":"1","ato":"0","posfrom":"-100,0","posto":"-200,0","focus":"all","duration":"2","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":82},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","focus":"n","id":83},{"type":"text","text":"突如其来的石块几乎划过记者的鼻尖，它径直撞破后边的店铺橱窗。","id":84},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":85},{"type":"shake","name":"middle","power":"2","times":"70","fadetime":"0.5","block":"false","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"啊——","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","focus":"none","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的谢拉格人","text":"维多利亚滚出谢拉格！","id":89},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的谢拉格人","text":"恩希欧迪斯、蔓珠院、我们，都和你没有半点干系！","id":90},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.4","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"40","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"愤怒的谢拉格人","text":"还敢再拍？给我*谢拉格俚语*滚！","id":92},{"type":"dialog","id":93},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":95},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"none","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"没有什么比这一刻更令她五味杂陈。","id":97},{"type":"text","text":"她看到平凡生活中的谢拉格人，渐渐变得多疑、烦躁。","id":98},{"type":"text","text":"她更看到了曾经推心置腹的摄制组成员们，竟潜进她的房间，对着她的稿纸和相机反复检视......","id":99},{"type":"dialog","id":100},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","id":101},{"type":"dialog","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":103},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":104},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","posfrom":"-70,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":105},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":106},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":107},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":108},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":109},{"type":"charslot","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"当男人再次掏出一块石头，记者朝受访者鞠躬告别，跑离了现场......","id":111},{"type":"text","text":"似乎只有逃跑这一种选择......然而，她又能逃到哪里？","id":112},{"type":"dialog","id":113},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":114},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":115,"musicid":1},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_67_G4_kjeragstreet.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","id":118},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":120},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":122},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","focus":"r","id":123},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格儿童","text":"姐姐，你是维多利亚人吗？","id":124,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":125},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"啊......小朋友，你好。","id":126,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E0/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......你，不讨厌维多利亚吗？","id":128,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","focus":"r","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格儿童","text":"嗯，我不讨厌。","id":130,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2002_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":131},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":132},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","id":133},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":134},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":135},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-150,0","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":137},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":138},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"-150,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":139},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":141},{"type":"text","text":"脏兮兮的小手递过来一块发硬的维多利亚面包。","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","focus":"r","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格儿童","text":"只是爸爸和我说，要把这些全部丢掉，我们家绝不能要维多利亚人施舍的东西。","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2002_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"那......","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1$1","focus":"r","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格儿童","text":"但耶拉冈德教导我们，谢拉格人要爱自己的邻人，还要知恩图报。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2002_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"谢拉格儿童","text":"所以，我想把它还给你。","id":149,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_npc_2002_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":150},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_walkfast","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"r","id":152},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_2002_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"150,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1","block":"true","id":153},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":154},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"none","id":157},{"type":"text","text":"望着匆匆离去的孩子的背影，记者仿佛被手中的干面包噎住了咽喉，她眼睑微颤，牙关紧锁......","id":158},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","focus":"m","id":160},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":161},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":162},{"type":"charslot","id":163},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_stickimp","id":164},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.3","block":"true","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":168},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"2","id":169},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.01","fillto":"0.2","grad":"true","fadetime":"2","id":170},{"type":"bg","id":171,"from":"0","to":"1","duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"backgroundtween","yFrom":"0","yTo":"100","xScaleFrom":"1","xScaleTo":"1.1","yScaleFrom":"1","yScaleTo":"1.1","duration":"5","block":"false","id":172},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":173},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":174},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.2","fillto":"1","grad":"true","fadetime":"1.5","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"playsound","key":"$bodyfalldown1","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"dialogue","name":"模糊的声音","text":"把她带上车，别被人发现。","id":179},{"type":"text","text":"这是她昏迷前，能记得的最后的声音。","id":180},{"type":"dialog","id":181},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":182},{"type":"charslot","id":183},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":184},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"0","id":185},{"type":"bg","from":"1","to":"0","duration":"0","block":"false","id":186},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_dia_street_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta3_181101/m_dia_street_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":187,"musicid":2},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_bg_45_g11_karlanheadquarters.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":190},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":192},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":193},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":194},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":195},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"抱歉又来上门叨扰了，恩希欧迪斯先生。","id":196,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"或许在这焦头烂额的当口，你更想见其他人......","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":198},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"这话说得太见外了。","id":199,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"谢拉格曾承蒙你的关照，我正想寻找机会当面致谢。","id":200,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":201},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"哪里......这次来谢拉格故地重游，也是感慨万千啊。","id":202,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"每次我都想带来些好消息，再把这身老骨头丢到雪山里清净清净。","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":204},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"可世事无常，总得学会即兴，不是吗？","id":205,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":206},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"不过我想，子爵阁下也应该不是为了开斯特公爵，而给我传达坏消息的。","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"嗯，那个老婆子的事，我再也不想掺和了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":210},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"虽然从我上次来到谢拉格的状况看......应该是她更不愿意让我掺和。","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":212},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"那么，子爵阁下......","id":213,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":214},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"嗐，说正事说正事，知道你忙。","id":215,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"我是来向你告别的，恩希欧迪斯先生。","id":217,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"如果是近期关于维多利亚的舆论为您带来了麻烦，我可以——","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"不不不......不只是这样......","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"......我原抱着一丁点不切实际的期待，想着老婆子也到了“其言也善”的年纪。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#8$1","focus":"l","id":224},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"那总该真表示点善心吧？可你瞧瞧，还是闹成了现在这样。","id":225,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"虽然会显得我老糊涂了，但我忍不住想当面问你一句......","id":227,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#12$1","focus":"l","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"真没有别的办法了吗？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/23/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"阁下，你知道她的企图，并非几片矿场而已。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#9$1","focus":"r","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"从对恩希亚动手开始，这便已经是我无法接受的谈判。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6E/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#15$1","focus":"l","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"所以你打算怎么对付她呢？难道真的准备和她刀兵相见？","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-15$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"阁下比我清楚，如果不把“刀兵相见”作为一种底线，或许谢拉格已经是她囊中之物了。","id":237,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":238},{"type":"multiline","name":"哈洛德","text":"我当然......","id":239},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#16$1","focus":"l","id":240},{"type":"multiline","name":"哈洛德","text":"唉，该说什么好。","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":242},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"老婆子的性情嘛，你和她闹到这个份上，她也绝不会善罢甘休。","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/92/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":244},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"恩希欧迪斯大人，我也是发自内心地为您担忧，这接下来可该怎么办呦。","id":245,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":246},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"除了“顺势而为”，又能怎么办呢？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5F/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"说起来，阁下和开斯特公爵也是老相识了？","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/71/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#7$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"multiline","name":"哈洛德","text":"我？","id":251},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":252},{"type":"multiline","name":"哈洛德","text":"不熟不熟不熟。","id":253},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":254},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"前几年倒会聊聊家常，她总和我提那些小开斯特们，牙痒痒地说就没一个成器的。","id":255,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":256},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"越没成器的，她做事也就越着急，谁能想到她年轻时那叫一个深不可测......","id":257,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":258},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"十多年前，我也和公爵阁下有一面之缘，她的高贵姿态犹在眼前。","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"哈，和我就没必要这么讲了。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"我都懂的，她那股子高高在上的贵族做派根本不可能改。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#14$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"背地里算计再多，明面上也得搞出一副高傲体面的样子。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-14$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":266},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#14$1","focus":"none","id":267},{"type":"playsound","key":"$doorknockquite","id":268},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":269},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":270},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"......行了，你的下属还有更要紧的事麻烦你，我也该离开了。","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#11$1","focus":"r","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......和阁下交流，受益匪浅。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E8/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"希望，能在未来有更恰当的时机邀请阁下造访谢拉格。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#4$1","focus":"l","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"哈哈，那就再好不过啦！","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/91/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"哎，对了......","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"（压低声音）你见到公爵阁下的时候，可千万别告诉她，我背地里喊她老婆子。","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_172_svrash_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"恩希欧迪斯","text":"......当然，子爵阁下。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2B/Avg_avg_172_svrash_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#6$1","focus":"l","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"当然，当然......","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4114_harold_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"哈洛德","text":"我也是真的盼望，还有机会能再次拜访谢拉格。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_4114_harold_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":289},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E1/Avg_bg_24_g5_guestroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"bg","id":295,"from":"1","to":"1","duration":"0","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":296},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":297},{"type":"dialogue","name":"模糊的声音","text":"是的，没有人发现。","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"模糊的声音","text":"不为难，夫人的要求我一定......","id":299},{"type":"dialogue","name":"模糊的声音","text":"我这就把她带过来。","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"......","id":301},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"喂，醒醒！","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":304},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.4","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":305},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"1","fillto":"0.4","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":306},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":307},{"type":"curtain","direction":"0","fillfrom":"0.4","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":308},{"type":"curtain","direction":"4","fillfrom":"0.4","fillto":"0","grad":"true","fadetime":"3","id":309},{"type":"bg","id":310,"from":"1","to":"0","duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":311},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":312},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":313},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#12$1","id":314},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkalley_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act5d0/m_avg_longmendarkalley_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":315,"musicid":3},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......我，这是，记得在——","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F6/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-12$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_284_1$1","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶家护卫","text":"半天都没睡够啊？赶快起来，我们夫人有话问你。","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#11$1","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"什么......","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#11$1","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"是谁，找我......","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"啧，你下手什么时候才能分清楚轻重？","id":324},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_284_1$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶家护卫","text":"对，对不起。","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"布朗陶家护卫","text":"大夫人。","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C9/Avg_avg_npc_284_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":328},{"type":"dialog","id":329},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#1$1","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1","block":"true","id":330},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"喂，现在清醒点了吗？","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"别乱动，除非你嫌手上的绳子勒得不够疼。","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......","id":336,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"啊，菈塔托丝！","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......菈塔托丝大人，我以为你——","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#1$1","id":341},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"看到我没有一处是烧焦的，很惊讶吧？","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"有机会的话告诉你的同事，和布朗陶家打交道时，最好检查一下房间里的机关。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#11$1","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"我的......同事？","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"老实交代吧，小间谍，你鬼鬼祟祟那么多天，究竟想拍到些什么？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#6$1","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"什么......不，您误会了！我怎么会是间谍呢？！","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/98/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"唉......","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"每个被抓住的间谍都是这么和我说的。","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":355},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","id":356},{"type":"text","text":"一旁的护卫从记者的背包拿出些东西甩到了地上——是她这么多天来拍摄、洗印的照片。","id":357},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","id":358},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"拍拍风土人情，甚至巡逻的家丁，倒也懒得管你。","id":359,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","id":360},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"而你毫无顾忌，不但在蔓珠院里拍了一路，甚至还跑进几座山里到处按快门。","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"别以为我什么都不知道。","id":362,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#9$1","id":363},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"......","id":364,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#2$1","id":365},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"菈塔托丝大人，不管你是否相信，我真的只是一名普通记者。","id":366,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":367},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"如果我真是间谍，那么为什么要随身携带这些物证到街上闲逛？","id":368,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":369},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"何况现在局势如此混乱，我大可把这些全部交给电视台同事保管。","id":370,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","id":371},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"这就是你需要解释的了，记者。","id":372,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#7$1","id":373},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"事实是你携带大量可疑资料，行踪诡异，我怎么知道你不是想逃跑？","id":374,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/48/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.2","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"40","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":375},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#7$1","id":376},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"因为我在保护这些资料！","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":378},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"开斯特公爵要管控舆情，新闻办公室便派了人进驻摄制组，他们删改、剪辑我拍摄的内容，搜我的房间。","id":379,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"我要是不逃跑，你所看到的绝大多数素材都会被他们没收，甚至歪曲使用。","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#7$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"他们做的这一切，最终都是为了洗白维多利亚想要强行介入谢拉格内政的行为！","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/73/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","id":384},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":385,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":386},{"type":"dialogue","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"菈塔托丝大人，如果你觉得这些素材还有利于谢拉格，我可以全部交给你。","id":387,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_2006_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#9$1","id":388},{"type":"multiline","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"只要你能把这些内容发布出去，让更多人知道，谢拉格正在发生什么......","id":389},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_2006_1#10$1","id":390},{"type":"multiline","name":"维多利亚记者","text":"它不需要维多利亚人的“帮扶”，而需要真正的帮助！","id":391},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#2$1","id":392},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"......","id":393,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/95/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#5$1","id":394},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"难办了。","id":395,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#9$1","id":396},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"这个时候，恩希欧迪斯还能接电话吗？","id":397,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C8/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":398},{"type":"dialog","id":399},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$dooropenquite","id":401},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":402},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":403},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#1$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","afrom":"0","ato":"1","duration":"1.5","block":"true","id":404},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":405},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"他有更紧要的事处理，所以只派了我来支援。","id":406,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/82/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","id":407},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"假死之后，我抓的这几个间谍也都交给他了，按约定他早就得派人来支援我了。","id":408,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"结果只派了一个人，但是是黑骑士。","id":409},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","id":410},{"type":"multiline","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我到底该说他是大方还是小气呢......","id":411},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#7$1","id":412},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"......","id":413,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#4$1","id":414},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"对付开斯特公爵，他现在有什么主意？","id":415,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/E6/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#11$1","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"还在收集敌人的信息，派我来帮你审问也有这个原因。","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FC/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4116_blkkgt_1#6$1","id":418},{"type":"dialogue","name":"锏","text":"现在最关键的是，这位记者到底有没有拍到“山里的东西”。","id":419,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/84/Avg_avg_4116_blkkgt_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#1$1","id":420},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"那么，这位朋友......","id":421,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/08/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#10$1","id":422},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"我可以先给你松绑，也请你保证......","id":423,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_253_1#11$1","id":424},{"type":"dialogue","name":"菈塔托丝","text":"对我接下来的提问有问必答，好吗？","id":425,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/89/Avg_avg_npc_253_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":428},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":429},{"type":"image","id":430},{"type":"charslot","id":431}],"characters":["维多利亚记者","匆忙的谢拉格人","温和的谢拉格人","愤怒的谢拉格人","谢拉格儿童","模糊的声音","哈洛德","恩希欧迪斯","？？？","布朗陶家护卫","菈塔托丝","锏"]}